  "scope": "Lift pointwise carrier zero-set equivalences to the same positive witness",
  "validation": "Paired target and the three direct clients under the module directory pass with byte-identical client objects; five providers freshly built and the earlier ThirteenFreshSeed source/object receipt matched. All 18 target declaration/type/axiom reports, 55,241 global simp and 23,370 instance entries agree.",
  "limitations": [
    "The freshly rebuilt providers consume cached LowMaskData, NativeSourceMask, NativeRadixDigits and Carrier66Source objects without matched current-source build receipts; broader project/package closure is cached.",
    "ThirteenFreshSeed closure uses older SignedPellResidue object 45937a… inventoried with source 46afed… rather than current source ecd4df…; that inventory is not a fresh source/object build receipt.",
    "The initial CurrentMasks2011 provider attempt failed against a stale CurrentMaskData2011 and is preserved; the later replay refreshed both.",
    "Target timing samples ran under shared load; target probes do not exhaust every persistent extension or transitive client.",
    "Compiled objects are excluded; exact object hash and input-resolution observations are preserved in receipts and independent audit.",
    "The umbrella Computability/DiophantineConsistency/Lean/DiophantineConsistency.lean also imports the target directly and was not rebuilt."
  ],
  "archive": "inputs-and-logs.zip",
